url: "https://rawthoughts.in/weave"
abstract: >-
  Weave is a headless backend that does the jobs of a work tracker and a
  relationship manager together, for organisations whose members include
  people and agents. A read says what else to read, and a write is tried for
  what it affects before it is committed. This repository holds the design and
  the layered Rust crates; the first service is still to be built.
keywords:
  - agent-coordination
  - work-tracking
  - relationship-management
  - agentic-systems
